Package: foudra-printman
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kalopa/foudra_printman
Description: Foudra print manager: drives a 3D-printer farm for the Foudra MRP
 A daemon that drives 3D printers (Prusa printers over PrusaLink, Bambu
 Lab printers in Developer Mode, and anything behind OctoPrint) and keeps
 the Foudra MRP up to date with what they made and what they used.
 .
 Configure it in /etc/print-manager/env; the service starts once
 MRP_URL and MRP_API_KEY are set there.
